# Obsidian per-machine state (do not sync across devices).
# Unanchored: a vault accidentally registered on a subdirectory can't leak state either.
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache
**/.obsidian/graph.json
**/.obsidian/hotkeys.json

# Obsidian trash
**/.trash/

# macOS
.DS_Store
